From c6945b4f96635376db8da4f19ced050a33a044ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simo Sorce <simo@redhat.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 15:48:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 24/36] Add FIPS indicator for test facilities

Introduces the `rh_test_facilities_disallowed` parameter to the FIPS
provider to control the use of internal test features. ML-DSA, ML-KEM
and SLH_DSA key generation as well as ML-DSA signature generation and
ML_KEM Key Exchange are updated to evaluate this indicator when a manual
seed is provided outside of self- testing. This ensures unapproved
deterministic key generation can trigger an indicator callback that
applications can use.

Signed-off-by: Simo Sorce <simo@redhat.com>
---
 providers/fips/fipsprov.c                      |  2 +-
 .../fips/include/fips_indicator_params.inc     |  1 +
 providers/implementations/kem/ml_kem_kem.c     | 18 ++++++++++++++++--
 .../implementations/keymgmt/ml_dsa_kmgmt.c     | 13 +++++++++++++
