Subject: [PATCH 25/36] Add rh_test_facilities option to fipsinstall

This introduces the -rh_test_facilities command-line option to the fipsinstall
application and writes it to the generated FIPS configuration file. It
provides a mechanism to enable specific test-only data and facilities that
must remain disabled in production environments. The FIPS prep test recipe has
also been updated to use this new flag.

