Subject: [PATCH 26/36] Add missing public key assurance tests

This adds necessary public key validation checks for EC key generation and RSA
encryption/encapsulation when operating within the FIPS module. These checks
ensure compliance with public key assurance requirements in FIPS mode.

Signed-off-by: Simo Sorce <simo@redhat.com>
---
